Subject: [PATCH 03/23] ADB warning in the greeting and as a dot on the library
 button; weather lines never cut
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A separate red button took the header's width and cut the weather. adb_warning
(boolean) now turns the greeting red and dots the library button. A weather
line that does not fit keeps its first ' · ' part instead of an ellipsis.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
